Subject: [PATCH] Prepare Bio Bank for on-site lab deployment

- Remove secrets from appsettings.json (Telegram token, remote DB password);
  site secrets now load from gitignored appsettings.Local.json / env vars
- Run as a Windows Service (auto-start, auto-restart) with fixed content root
- Production DB: SQL Server Express; LocalDB kept for Development
- Auto-apply EF migrations on startup (Startup:AutoMigrate)
- Demo users with known passwords only seeded in Development;
  site admin created from AdminSeed config
- HTTPS redirection configurable (LAN runs on http://0.0.0.0:5000)
- Anonymous /healthz endpoint (status only) for scripts and monitoring
- IoT test console disabled outside Development
- deploy/: machine prep, Mosquitto auth, service install, health check,
  and an MQTT freezer simulator for end-to-end alarm testing
- DEPLOYMENT.md: step-by-step Arabic deployment and acceptance guide

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
